Dear Mr. Benander,

Your submission entitled "A Condensed Overview of the Aethic Solution to the Measurement Problem" has been received. Before we can further process it, you are kindly requested to

1.The position of Figure Citation(fig.6,7) is not defined in the manuscript. Please make sure the figure is cited in the text and indicate where it should be placed.

2.The position of Table Citation (table1,2) is not defined in the manuscript. Please indicate where the table needs to be placed.

Please log onto Editorial Manager as an author.  

Your username is: AjaxB 
If you forgot your password, you can click the 'Send Login Details' link on the EM Login page at https://www.editorialmanager.com/synt/

Go to the menu item 'Submissions Sent Back to Author', and click on 'Edit Submission'. If no changes are to be made in the metadata, please go to the submission step 'attach files', and upload your corrected submission. Build the PDF, view your submission, and approve the changes.

Thank you for submitting your work to this journal.

With kind regards,
Saranya Mohan
Springer Journals Editorial Office
Synthese


