The PDF for your manuscript, "Extrusion Without Duplication: Aethic Time, Collapse, and Observer-Relative Reality" is ready for viewing.

In order to formally submit your manuscript to the journal, you must approve the PDF.

Please access the journal website.

Your username is: AjaxB 
If you forgot your password, you can click the 'Send Login Details' link on the EM Login page at https://www.editorialmanager.com/synt/

