Thank you for your interest in the HPS doctoral program at the University o=
f Pittsburgh.  The Admissions Committee received applications from a very l=
arge number of candidates, many of them highly qualified, and after a lengt=
hy and thorough review, we are now in a position to inform you, with regret=
, that you are not among the small number who have been selected for admiss=
ion into the program.  Although we are not able to go into the consideratio=
ns on which we based our decisions in individual cases, I can assure you th=
at your application received a careful review, and I do wish you success in=
 your future endeavors.

Sincerely,

Marian Gilton
Director of Graduate Admissions
Department of History and Philosophy of Science=20
University of Pittsburgh

--_002_BN7PR04MB4097D290278C5752D10FB49CF86CABN7PR04MB4097namp_
